                        </p>
                        <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-4">
<table class="w-full table-fixed border-collapse break-words">                                <thead>
                                    <tr class="bg-yellow-100">
                                        <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold">DOCUMENTS</th>
